5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. I hope we can find a project that brings joy to the campus without causing too much stress for those building it.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to help! I really want to make sure we pick something that people will actually use and that doesn't mess up the classes.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I believe we should be practical. I want to see how our current staff are managing before we add more to their plate.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with George. We need a logical approach. I am interested in whether our past projects actually delivered the value they promised to the users.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent start. I suspect our budget projections are mere works of fiction, so I shall seek the cold, hard reality of the market.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, you always have such a sharp way of putting things! I worry about the timelines slipping, so I'll look into the delivery schedules and site diaries.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,That's a good idea! I'll check the booking data for the rooms and the timetable records to see how work affects our space.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will examine the staffing posts since the freeze and the manual routines the technicians have to deal with every week.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks to see where the hidden disappointments lie.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the tender records over the last three cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think we have a very balanced plan. I feel quite peaceful knowing we are looking at this from so many different angles.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Me too! I can't wait to see what we find. I hope it helps us make the best choice for everyone!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,It seems sufficient. I have no further additions to the list of records.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I concur. The division of labor is logical.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I shall await the revelations of the archives with my usual measured curiosity.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
